   "source": [
    "We know that:\n",
    "$$\\int \\frac{1}{x+1} \\, dx = \\ln|x+1| + C$$\n",
    "\n",
    "So if we apply to 0 - 4 interval we have: $\\int_{0}^{4} \\frac{1}{x+1} \\, dx = \\ln|x+1|\\Big|_{0}^{4} = \\ln(5) - ln(1) = ln(5)$\n",
    "\n",
    "We want to draw graphic of the area (definite integral).\n",
    "\n",
    "See the attached `graph_1.py` python file."
   ]
  }
